You would imagine that contacting such a group would  be more difficult, but it turned out to be pretty easy.
Just a matter of cashing in some favours here and there.
The Blinded, resided in a small abandoned space station, bound to make an eagle flight into the gas giant of it's own in a couple of years.
The once sterile interior was now filled with graffiti and vandalized propaganda posters. 
The chief of the place, a small framed man with an obviously broken nose and dark slacked back hair, welcomes you with a smile.
???: Salve, the name is Grig, with who do I've the pleasure? 
	->My name's Joh
		Grig: Welcome.
		Now that the presentation are done his face gets less welcoming and more focused. 
